{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[OFFICIAL DIRECTIVE - MINISTRY OF PURPOSE]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work Order Reference: 1001-63-OPRT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Date Issued: 11 March, 2049</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Issued under authority of The State.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ministry of Purpose has reviewed your records and determined your<strong><i> Purpose</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effective immediately, you are hereby conscripted to serve as a Terminal Operator at a secure facility located in Western Novagrad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further details on the duties of the position will be provided when appropriate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Purpose is not a request.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to uphold your Purpose will result in ramifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are expected to report for duty without delay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glory to The State</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TERMINAL OPERATOR</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a CRT-style terminal to control and monitor the secure facility under your charge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consult your Operator Manual for commands, syntax, and procedures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete shift requirements and manage staff tasks under strict deadlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contain classified subjects and prevent escape at all costs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure an atmosphere of isolation, hallucinations, and bureaucratic dread</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077110?t=1760050680","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077110?t=1760050680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/a0a4c5b86c258a70fc8934d714f3049993bb1b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760050680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077110/a0a4c5b86c258a70fc8934d714f3049993bb1b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760050680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mild jump scares with loud screams and sound effects."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[OFFICIAL DIRECTIVE - MINISTRY OF PURPOSE]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work Order Reference: 1001-63-OPRT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Date Issued: 11 March, 2049</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Issued under authority of The State.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizen,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ministry of Purpose has reviewed your records and determined your<strong><i> Purpose</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effective immediately, you are hereby conscripted to serve as a Terminal Operator at a secure facility located in Western Novagrad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further details on the duties of the position will be provided when appropriate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Purpose is not a request.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure to uphold your Purpose will result in ramifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are expected to report for duty without delay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glory to The State</p><p cla